      "id": "q1",
      "type": "writing",
      "content": "<p><strong>Verhuizing doorgeven</strong></p><p>U bent verhuisd. U geeft uw nieuwe adres door aan de gemeente. Vul het formulier in.</p><p><em>Vul het formulier in.</em></p><p><em>Sommige gegevens mag u zelf verzinnen.</em></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1rem 0;\"><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Achternaam</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Voornaam</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Geboortedatum</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Oud adres</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Nieuw adres</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Postcode en woonplaats (nieuw)</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Datum van verhuizing</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Aantal personen</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa; vertical-align: top;\">Waarom verhuist u?</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.75rem; vertical-align: top; height: 80px;\"></td></tr></table>",
